<title>CROATIA: Croatia Dec '96 real wage index 115.4 vs Nov's 111.</title>
<headline>Croatia Dec '96 real wage index 115.4 vs Nov's 111.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		 DEC '96    NOV '96     DEC '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    115.4	111.0	 101.7</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,217	2,124	 1,833</p>
<p> -Goods, services sector	  2,177	2,108	 1,826</p>
<p> -Public sector		     2,327	2,170	 2,039</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
